## Compact Namespaces

```yaml
compact:
  gov_c: "//gov/c/*"     → "go:/olym/c/*"
  gov_g: "//gov/g/*"     → "go:/olym/g/*"
  gov_s: "//gov/s/*"     → "go:/olym/s/*"
  gov_k: "//gov/k/*"     → "go:/olym/k/*"
  gov_x: "//gov/x/*"     → "go:/olym/x/*"
```

## Hok Namespace (Hookpoint Registry)

```yaml
hok_namespace:
  prefix: "hok://"
  examples:
    - "hok://actor/text-ractor/port"
    - "hok://io/rac/path_filter"
    - "hok://fem/cap/authority_gate"
```

## Identity & Authority IDs

```yaml
identifiers:
  HI: "HI://Sodino"              # Sovereign identity
  ARA: "ARA-64"                   # 64-bit bitmask authority
  ACM: "ACM://<domain>"           # Actor machine
  ARO: "ARO://<rel>"              # Relationship graph
  ATO: "ATO://<token>"            # Authority token
  ATK: "ATK://<key>"              # Authority key
  ALR: "ALR://<ledger>"           # Authority ledger
  ZES: "ZES://<seal>"             # Seal
  RC: "RC://<rule-contract>"      # Rule contract
  AFN: "AFN://<artifact>"         # Artifact functional node
  CAP: "CAP://<name>"             # Crystallized artifact particle
  NAP: "NAP://<name>"             # Nano artifact particle
  NEP: "NEP://<name>"             # Nano engine part
  AEP: "AEP://<epoch>"            # Authority epoch
  RFN: "RFN://<function>"         # Reified function node
  TEE: "TEE://<env>"              # Trusted execution env
```

